# NOTE: GitHub Pages does NOT serve Git LFS files — it serves the tiny LFS
# pointer text instead, which breaks Unity WebGL builds ("Failed to load.").
# So build artifacts (.data, .wasm, etc.) are committed as regular files.
# Keep each file under GitHub's 100 MB limit (enable Brotli/Gzip compression
# in Unity's WebGL player settings if a build gets too big).

# Source archives only — never referenced by the site
*.zip         filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

*.data        binary
*.wasm        binary
